{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Don't Go Unarmed</i> is an <strong>action-RPG roguelite</strong> where each run is unique and anything can happen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057710/extras/c55a24450714c6ef920d2c2e3903c920.poster.avif?t=1769147763\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057710/extras/c55a24450714c6ef920d2c2e3903c920.webm?t=1769147763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057710/extras/c55a24450714c6ef920d2c2e3903c920.mp4?t=1769147763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>EVERY RUN IS UNIQUE</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is new with randomly generated maps, upgrades and enemies. Find the shop to spend your gold on items and uncover the secrets that line the cavern walls. Combine the right upgrades, items and skill to defeat the bosses that stand in your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057710/extras/dd008a883b5f9389af12a747fb9605b9.poster.avif?t=1769147763\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057710/extras/dd008a883b5f9389af12a747fb9605b9.webm?t=1769147763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057710/extras/dd008a883b5f9389af12a747fb9605b9.mp4?t=1769147763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>UPGRADES &amp; SYNERGIES</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Kill monsters to gain experience, level up and choose your own destiny with the randomized <strong>skill</strong> tree.\u00a0Every floor has an <strong>upgrade</strong>\u00a0\u2013 improve your honor and acquire the upgrades of legends ...or follow a darker path and find the power the curses have to offer.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057710/extras/f9d2c80d41e28a758a8f206db907c0e4.poster.avif?t=1769147763\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057710/extras/f9d2c80d41e28a758a8f206db907c0e4.webm?t=1769147763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057710/extras/f9d2c80d41e28a758a8f206db907c0e4.mp4?t=1769147763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>GAME FEATURES:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1000+ unique rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150+ upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >75+ items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of <u>unique events</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 floors</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4057710?t=1769147763","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4057710?t=1769147763","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057710/82c2f7f46a702f9e47af6131c9877e632cd6b9ff/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769147763","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057710/82c2f7f46a702f9e47af6131c9877e632cd6b9ff/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769147763","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharin